    <string name="capture_dlg_title">Screen picker</string>
    <string name="capture_dlg_steps">Tap "Start" and the app goes to the background with a 12-second countdown: switch to the target app and arrange the popup. When time is up the current screen is captured — come back to LiteSkip and tick the labels to build a rule.</string>
